    "base_density_note": "Not on the sheet. The dye panel is normalised to a visual neutral of 1.0 and plots no D-min; the characteristic minimum is a status-A reading, not a spectral curve. A flat 0.10 is assumed, within the 0.09-0.13 range the shipped positives carry. Assumption, not a measurement.",
